WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.712
♪♪

00:00:03.795 --> 00:00:05.339
- I'm glad you're back.

00:00:06.507 --> 00:00:09.885
I'm just gonna take some time
gettin' used to.

00:00:10.552 --> 00:00:13.013
You just gotta get yourself
back out there.

00:00:14.056 --> 00:00:15.933
- Oh, my.

00:00:16.016 --> 00:00:18.769
You were All-USA player two
years in a row at Riverside?

00:00:18.852 --> 00:00:19.645
- Yes, sir.

00:00:21.647 --> 00:00:23.649
A whole lot's changed.

00:00:27.528 --> 00:00:30.239
- That boy? That's Sam.

00:00:30.322 --> 00:00:35.035
His momma took off.
He'll be stayin' with us 'till she's back.

00:00:36.370 --> 00:00:37.829
- You know you're a boy, right?

00:00:37.913 --> 00:00:38.872
- Yeah.

00:00:39.873 --> 00:00:42.960
♪ In the hours that I've known ♪

00:00:43.043 --> 00:00:46.672
- Do you know when
my mom is coming back?

00:00:46.755 --> 00:00:48.382
- He's gonna have to go in the system.

00:00:51.260 --> 00:00:54.096
- There's somethin'
seriously wrong with that kid.

00:00:54.179 --> 00:00:56.306
♪ Would you set me free? ♪

00:00:56.723 --> 00:00:58.433
- How did you end up in prison?

00:00:58.892 --> 00:01:01.019
- Don't matter.
I did what I did.

00:01:02.604 --> 00:01:03.981
- But look at what you did today.

00:01:05.941 --> 00:01:09.945
♪ And there's nowhere to hide ♪

00:01:10.028 --> 00:01:12.197
- Listen to me, son.
Kids are mean.

00:01:12.906 --> 00:01:15.534
Especially when they see something
that they ain't used to seein'.

00:01:16.076 --> 00:01:20.205
- You ain't nothin' but a criminal.
You got no right looking after any child.

00:01:20.289 --> 00:01:22.124
♪ Just set me free ♪

00:01:22.207 --> 00:01:25.294
- There's things in this world you can be,
and there's things that you can't.

00:01:25.377 --> 00:01:28.505
How many boys do you see on that show?

00:01:28.589 --> 00:01:29.756
- None.

00:01:29.840 --> 00:01:31.049
- What does that tell you?

00:01:31.133 --> 00:01:32.176
- That I can be the first.

00:01:33.260 --> 00:01:34.469
- Trick or treat!

00:01:34.553 --> 00:01:35.971
- Hi! Get some treats.

00:01:37.514 --> 00:01:41.268
- The truth is, I haven't felt
like I was good at anything...

00:01:41.351 --> 00:01:43.103
♪ Just set me free ♪

00:01:43.187 --> 00:01:43.937
- ...until Sam.

00:01:44.479 --> 00:01:48.025
♪ Keep running 'till
they learn to find peace ♪

00:01:48.108 --> 00:01:50.402
♪ Just set me free ♪

00:01:50.485 --> 00:01:51.570
- Shelly came back.

00:01:51.653 --> 00:01:52.946
(Sam shouting)

00:01:53.030 --> 00:01:54.448
- Get off of me!

00:01:54.531 --> 00:01:55.407
- Hey!

00:01:55.490 --> 00:01:56.408
- Hey!
- What--

00:01:56.491 --> 00:01:57.993
- Couldn't stay out of trouble, could ya?

00:01:58.076 --> 00:01:59.620
♪ Just set me free ♪

00:01:59.703 --> 00:02:01.246
- Palmer!

00:02:01.580 --> 00:02:02.998
- I can't abandon that boy.

00:02:04.666 --> 00:02:07.669
♪ Just set me free ♪

00:02:08.837 --> 00:02:10.339
- I will not abandon that boy.

00:02:11.924 --> 00:02:14.510
♪ Just set me free ♪

00:02:19.139 --> 00:02:20.682
- Heard y'all had a little
tea party the other day.

00:02:20.766 --> 00:02:21.767
- Ooh, yeah.

00:02:21.850 --> 00:02:23.435
- Careful, Palmer. It's hot.

00:02:23.519 --> 00:02:24.811
- Pinkies, please.

00:02:24.895 --> 00:02:26.438
- Mm.

00:02:26.522 --> 00:02:27.397
- Yes.

00:02:27.481 --> 00:02:28.398
- Mm, real good.

